<title>USA: CBOE to list PairGain Technologies LEAPS.</title>
<headline>CBOE to list PairGain Technologies LEAPS.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Board Options Exchange (CBOE) said it will list long-term equity anticipation securities (LEAPS) on PairGain Technologies Inc shares on June 11.</p>
<p>The LEAPS, which are long-term options, will have initial strike prices of 15, 20 and 25, CBOE said.</p>
<p>PairGain LEAPS expiring in January 1999 will trade under ticker symbol VGF and those expiring in January 2000 will trade under symbol LGC, the exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Derivatives Desk ((312-408-8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
